ttps://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75393560_1171020207450133_8492329113192424785_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-wQ0I7-1_DQQ7kNvwEEfa2m&_nc_oc=Adq0CMFJHpjRO38769ADJdxM1yW7HNY5y5NL5DX5KREYO9h-WTSb2lPxAaIAJ0u0ros&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2eGFsFC29Hb2HjbV6WW7NjeGE0tXXdqRqcgzaClVSNag&oe=69F2171A"}, "display_name": "Ninja's Last Stand", "keywords": [], "long_description": "In a world torn apart by war and chaos, the ancient art of the ninja is the last hope for survival. As the world descends into darkness, you, a skilled ninja warrior, must defend against relentless assaults using your katana and futuristic gun. Set against the backdrop of a war-torn landscape illuminated by the dying light of the setting sun, \"Ninja's Last Stand\" immerses you in a gripping narrative of honor, duty, and survival.\nKey Features\n\n1. Immersive VR Experience\n\n    Step into a fully immersive VR world where every slash of your katana and every shot from your gun feels real. The high-fidelity graphics and realistic soundscapes create an unparalleled sense of presence and engagement.", "short_description": "Storyline\n\nIn a world torn apart by war and chaos, the ancient art of the ninja is the last hope for survival. As the world descends into darkness, you, a skilled ninja warrior, must defend against relentless assaults using your katana and futuristic gun. Set against the backdrop of a war-torn landscape illuminated by the dying light of the setting sun, \"Ninja's Last Stand\" immerses you in a gripping narrative of honor, duty, and survival."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/ninjas-last-stand/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "WHR26 Invention", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/ninjas-last-stand", "category": null, "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id":